{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b3906521-2e59-8269-bbbb-77b379641d91",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T11:19:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Elvis Lopes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:16:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:16:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Yeah, I'm calling about the plowing. [pause] My car got plowed in. The city plow came down the street and left a wall of snow behind my car."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:16:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm sorry to hear that. Okay, let me get some details. What street are you on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:16:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bridge Street. 101 Bridge Street, down in the Point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:16:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "101 Bridge Street. Got it. And when did this happen? Was it with the storm over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:17:07-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, last weekend's storm, the snow-to-rain one. Sunday into Monday. The plow went through sometime Monday, I think, after it turned over to rain. So now it's all heavy and packed. Like cement."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:17:21-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that wet stuff is the worst. So the car is parked on the street in front of your place, and the plow pushed a bank in behind it or around it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:17:34-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Around it, yeah. Along the curb. It's boxed in on the back side, pretty much. I dug a little this morning but it's too heavy. [pause] My back isn't going to take much more of that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:17:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. And you'd like a plow to come back through and clear it, is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:17:56-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. If someone could send a plow back down, or a loader, whatever you use. I just need it opened up enough to get out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:18:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'm putting down a request for a return pass at 101 Bridge Street, car plowed in along the curb. I'll note it's heavy wet snow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:18:18-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. I have to get moving early too. I go over the bridge every morning and I wait for the drawbridge in Jamestown, so if I'm late leaving, it just gets worse."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:18:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, the drawbridge. That can eat up a lot of time. So you commute that way each morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:18:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Every morning. [sighs] So I try to be out the door early. Today I couldn't, because of the car."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:18:48-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll make a note that you need to be out early. I can't promise a time, since the crews are busy with everything after the storm, but the request goes to the supervisor today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:19:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I just want it on the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:19:08-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's on the list. Can I get a callback number in case the crew has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:19:16-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. 401-555-0172."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:19:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read that back. 401-555-0172. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:19:22-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:19:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:19:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Elvis Lopes. L-O-P-E-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:19:28-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Lopes. So, to repeat it back: Elvis Lopes, 101 Bridge Street, car plowed in from the city plow after the weekend storm, requesting a return pass. Did I get it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:19:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's everything. Thanks for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:19:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Hang in there, and take it easy on your back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T11:19:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Bye now."
    }
  ],
